00:55:10,060 --> 00:55:12,700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ratio has been reducing

535
00:55:12,700 --> 00:55:20,980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: As time goes on, and we cannot have an arsenal which is equivalent to a Philippine mint,

536
00:55:21,160 --> 00:55:34,040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which is a sovereign capability, not doing highly technical and technologically advanced activities on a sovereign basis.

537
00:55:34,040 --> 00:55:41,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the NDCP, it has been undergoing a transition phase.

538
00:55:41,120 --> 00:55:52,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This time, even with the review of curriculum and a review of the indicators that we have,

539
00:55:53,680 --> 00:56:01,940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I have taken a personal role in reviewing the outputs that I require of them

540
00:56:01,940 --> 00:56:10,280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and the introduction of the notion that national security is multidisciplinary

541
00:56:10,280 --> 00:56:13,780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and we cannot have a set paradigm for national security.

542
00:56:13,800 --> 00:56:20,720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: With more emphasis on research output, not only of the students but of the faculty,

543
00:56:21,140 --> 00:56:27,580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's publish or die slowly that will be the output requirement.

544
00:56:28,900 --> 00:56:41,700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next, for OCD, as we said, their accomplishment was high,

545
00:56:41,700 --> 00:56:48,260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but I would like to see more responsive and more preemptive actions.

546
00:56:49,240 --> 00:56:57,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And more coordinated efficiency within them.

547
00:56:58,190 --> 00:57:02,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And more structured approaches to partnerships on a more sustainable basis.

548
00:57:02,160 --> 00:57:02,420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

549
00:57:06,640 --> 00:57:10,069
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

550
00:57:12,079 --> 00:57:15,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Uh, veterans welfare. It's there and, uh, the

551
00:57:15,040 --> 00:57:22,789
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: veterans, uh, memorial historical preservation. There are other targets that we need to do,

552
00:57:22,799 --> 00:57:25,910
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Uh, uh, that we need to preserve and we

553
00:57:25,920 --> 00:57:34,710
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: need to optimize certain areas for both joint and shrine use.

554
00:57:34,720 --> 00:57:37,670
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

555
00:57:37,680 --> 00:57:47,820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: VMMC. Uh, the number of outpatients treated have increased.

556
00:57:47,820 --> 00:58:02,520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The 11,100 inpatients treated goes to show that only about, to date,

557
00:58:02,520 --> 00:58:10,200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 9% of the veterans can be accommodated in the VMMC.

558
00:58:11,240 --> 00:58:20,500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we continue to try to reach out on a preventive basis to them

559
00:58:20,500 --> 00:58:24,560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because hospitalizations in the center right now

560
00:58:24,560 --> 00:58:31,620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: are something that we need to remediate

561
00:58:31,620 --> 00:58:35,620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: so that the center can be totally refurbished.

562
00:58:35,620 --> 00:58:39,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the infection rate is quite high,

563
00:58:39,920 --> 00:58:46,820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: given the fact that it is an old design, a dormitory design, post-World War II.

564
00:58:46,820 --> 00:58:52,180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And just like the DND proper building, it was molding.

565
00:58:52,180 --> 00:58:58,100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And not in the VMMC, but the DND building, there was even asbestos.

566
00:58:58,100 --> 00:59:01,240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we had to refurbish it.

567
00:59:01,620 --> 00:59:10,200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we are now working off-site, scattered in different locations.

568
00:59:11,080 --> 00:59:16,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's a challenge because it's a legacy building, but it needed to be done.

569
00:59:17,840 --> 00:59:22,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: With a single elevator, which is not PWD-friendly.

570
00:59:23,620 --> 00:59:26,620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it was used as a service elevator as well.

571
00:59:26,620 --> 00:59:30,000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it spent more time being conked out than not.

572
00:59:30,480 --> 00:59:33,510
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide.

573
00:59:33,520 --> 00:59:35,359
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Financial accomplishments.

574
00:59:35,359 --> 00:59:38,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

575
00:59:38,960 --> 00:59:45,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Obligation rates sometimes are less than optimal

576
00:59:45,480 --> 00:59:50,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of the fact that approved bid ceilings are low.

577
00:59:51,640 --> 00:59:56,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And because of the fact that in the defense space,

578
00:59:56,560 --> 00:59:59,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: material goes up in price.

579
00:59:59,180 --> 01:00:02,420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's a seller's and a supplier's market.

580
01:00:03,720 --> 01:00:06,440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So rather than pull the trigger on certain things,

581
01:00:06,440 --> 01:00:16,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we'd rather not if it will result in an unsustainable or unsupportable expenditure.

582
01:00:17,100 --> 01:00:18,220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide.

583
01:00:22,880 --> 01:00:28,710
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the first semester of 2026, we have almost a 50% obligation versus allotment

584
01:00:28,720 --> 01:00:34,309
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and 85% disbursement versus obligation.

585
01:00:34,319 --> 01:00:37,670
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

586
01:00:37,680 --> 01:00:39,359
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Uh, comparatives.

587
01:00:39,359 --> 01:00:39,715
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

588
01:00:42,640 --> 01:00:48,309
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Uh, the comparatives, uh, from 2021 as the base

589
01:00:51,170 --> 01:00:57,830
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the disbursement versus obligation rates have reduced

590
01:00:57,830 --> 01:01:02,830
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of the increasing cost of material versus the budget.

591
01:01:08,160 --> 01:01:17,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, uh, the same financial management principle will be followed

592
01:01:17,340 --> 01:01:18,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: if defense management...

593
01:01:18,940 --> 01:01:24,600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If the material doesn't go any cheaper and the approved bid ceilings

594
01:01:24,600 --> 01:01:29,620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: versus the release of funds becomes...

595
01:01:29,620 --> 01:01:35,750
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The gap is increasing, then we cannot obligate the amounts.

596
01:01:35,760 --> 01:01:38,870
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

597
01:01:38,880 --> 01:01:40,390
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Issues and concerns.

598
01:01:40,400 --> 01:01:40,660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

599
01:01:46,480 --> 01:01:56,130
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: These are the perennial issues and concerns that we have.

600
01:01:56,130 --> 01:02:01,560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of note, just to summarize,

601
01:02:02,720 --> 01:02:06,960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: as a result of the budgeting and the modernization process,

602
01:02:07,220 --> 01:02:09,340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we are still in Horizon 2 projects.

603
01:02:10,320 --> 01:02:17,760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: A lot of Horizon 2 projects we had to cancel already for being obsolete.

604
01:02:19,580 --> 01:02:24,380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we've had to revise Horizon 3 several times

605
01:02:24,380 --> 01:02:28,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to reflect new threats and new developments.

606
01:02:29,140 --> 01:02:31,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

607
01:02:31,280 --> 01:02:33,270
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

608
01:02:33,280 --> 01:02:39,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This was included in the GAA of last year.

609
01:02:39,359 --> 01:02:43,900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And since it will be subject to the control of the DOF,

610
01:02:44,020 --> 01:02:46,460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we respectfully move for its adoption again.

611
01:02:46,720 --> 01:02:50,100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If there is an opportunity that can be financed

612
01:02:50,100 --> 01:02:52,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and is acceptable to the finance department,

613
01:02:53,020 --> 01:02:54,860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: then we should take advantage of it,

614
01:02:55,480 --> 01:02:57,910
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: particularly if we can get longer tenor financing.

615
01:02:58,319 --> 01:02:59,599
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next.

616
01:03:02,880 --> 01:03:04,280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you, Madam Chair.

