Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Last year pa po yung commitment na iimbestigahan at pag-uusapan yung filing of charges at nababahala po tayo na hanggang ngayon, wala pang update pagdating.

1461
02:46:12,079 --> 02:46:19,909
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: May gawa ng dami po ng mga disaster na nangyayari at kailangan pagtuunan ng pansin.

1462
02:46:19,919 --> 02:46:27,749
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Lalo-lalo na po ngayon, ang dami dyan sa mga areas na yan ay sa barm area na nakatutok po yung mga tao para maiwasan kung anumang violence na mangyari.

1463
02:46:27,759 --> 02:46:35,589
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At yan po ay ino-augmentan pa namin ng tao para lang masigurado na successful yung election.

1464
02:46:35,599 --> 02:46:43,429
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So susubukan po natin na bago plenary.

1465
02:46:43,439 --> 02:46:51,269
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero kung hindi nun po namin…

1466
02:46:51,279 --> 02:46:55,389
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kung hindi namin maabot, it needs to be settled also between us.

1467
02:46:55,399 --> 02:46:59,509
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair.

1468
02:46:59,519 --> 02:47:03,630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat po hindi po mayag ang Committee on Appropriations na hindi magkaroon ng maayos na report dito.

1469
02:47:03,640 --> 02:47:07,750
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po sa DND, pero maski po sa DPWH na sila naman po yung nag-undertake ng bidding, etc., yung mismo construction.

1470
02:47:07,760 --> 02:47:11,870
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil hindi po biro ang 15 billion pesos.

1471
02:47:11,880 --> 02:47:15,990
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay kalahati na ng buong budget ng DOST.

1472
02:47:16,000 --> 02:47:19,030
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So imagine how huge that…

1473
02:47:19,040 --> 02:47:22,070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Amount is.

1474
02:47:22,080 --> 02:47:27,670
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And next, Madam Chair, gusto ko pong magtanong tungkol sa revised AFP, Modernization Program.

1475
02:47:27,680 --> 02:47:33,269
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi niyo ko na may mga sampung agreement na napirmahan sa ilalim ng programa na ito.

1476
02:47:33,279 --> 02:47:52,389
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Can you share what particular agreements have been signed in relation to this program?

1477
02:47:52,399 --> 02:47:56,309
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: You can only give the category because these are restricted.

1478
02:47:56,319 --> 02:48:03,990
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So these are some major weapon systems, some domain awareness systems for external defense.

1479
02:48:04,000 --> 02:48:16,150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Can you also share, Madam Chair, sino po yung… o ano yung mga bansa na kausap natin sa mga bilateral agreements na ito?

1480
02:48:16,160 --> 02:48:22,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kontrata po ito. G2G halos lahat. And it's from a host of countries.

1481
02:48:22,080 --> 02:48:22,950
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

1482
02:48:22,960 --> 02:48:24,230
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Not only one.

1483
02:48:24,240 --> 02:48:25,670
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Which are? Okay.

1484
02:48:25,680 --> 02:48:32,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We cannot disclose some of them, Your Honor, because if they tie the system…

1485
02:48:32,960 --> 02:48:37,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to the country of origin, makukompromiso na po yung sistema.

1486
02:48:37,040 --> 02:48:38,630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

1487
02:48:38,640 --> 02:48:54,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So all I can say, they are like-minded countries who share shared interests in the West Philippine Sea with us.

1488
02:48:54,160 --> 02:48:58,870
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, Madam Chair, hingin na lang din po ng representation na ito, yung ulat ng PNP.

1489
02:48:58,880 --> 02:49:04,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Those countries that will not pose a supply chain problem because of…

1490
02:49:04,960 --> 02:49:07,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Conditions attaining in those countries.

1491
02:49:07,359 --> 02:49:14,549
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes. So, report on the AFP modernization program from the year 1995 to this year.

1492
02:49:14,559 --> 02:49:21,750
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hingin po natin para makapaghanda rin sa mga… ilan pa nating katanungan tungkol sa programa na ito.

1493
02:49:21,760 --> 02:49:27,616
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Chair, tungkol naman po sa pag-fire ng Tomahawk missile mula Takloban na ang impact area ay sa Nueva Ecija bilang parte ng balikatang exercises.

1494
02:49:27,626 --> 02:49:33,483
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sino po ang nag-a-approve ba?

1495
02:49:33,493 --> 02:49:39,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang Republika po ng Pilipinas.

1496
02:49:39,359 --> 02:49:58,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Based on list of approved activities na every year po ating pinapasukan with the United States MDB Mutual Defense Board na pinamumunuan po ng DFA.

1497
02:49:58,960 --> 02:50:03,610
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ganito pong activities, meron bang rule yung local government units natin pagdating po sa matter lang ng information?

1498
02:50:03,620 --> 02:50:08,270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na magkakaroon ng ganito?

1499
02:50:08,280 --> 02:50:12,930
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Nasa operational security na po namin yan at sinisigurado namin po na walang pinsala sa community.

1500
02:50:12,940 --> 02:50:17,590
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kaya nga po ang nilapagan nito ay Fort Magsaysay mismo.

1501
02:50:17,600 --> 02:50:23,611
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright, Madam Chair. Nag-raise tayo dito ng concern dahil nung nakita nga natin sa balitan na Tomahawk missiles

1502
02:50:23,621 --> 02:50:29,632
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi naman lingit din sa ating kaalaman na ginagamit din po sa mga gera ngayon na nangyayari sa West Asia, sa Middle East, sa Iran.

1503
02:50:29,642 --> 02:50:35,653
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay nababahala po.

1504
02:50:35,663 --> 02:50:41,674
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Presentasyon na ito na nangyayari na ito sa ating kapuloan.

1505
02:50:41,684 --> 02:50:47,695
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, tungkol pa rin sa balikatan exercises, tungkol dun sa nasa 6,300 na mga official folk na affected ng fishing ban

1506
02:50:47,705 --> 02:50:53,716
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kung saan po natin sinasagawa ang balikatan exercises.

1507
02:50:53,726 --> 02:50:59,737
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi po ay may binibigay per person na tulong, aid, dahil hindi sila makapangisda sa duration ng balikatan exercises.

1508
02:50:59,747 --> 02:51:05,758
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabigyan na po ba lahat itong mga mga...

1509
02:51:05,768 --> 02:51:11,779
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Panginisda na naapektuhan ang kanilang kapuhayan dahil dito?

1510
02:51:11,789 --> 02:51:17,801
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Tayo po sa local government units ay natutulungan po lahat.

1511
02:51:17,811 --> 02:51:23,822
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ito ay tulong din ng BFAR at ng iba pong maahensya.

1512
02:51:23,832 --> 02:51:29,843
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, saan ang gagaling ang fund para dito?

1513
02:51:29,853 --> 02:51:35,864
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang tumutulong po dito ay BFAR.

1514
02:51:35,874 --> 02:51:41,885
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Oo po. Sila po ang tumutulong.

1515
02:51:41,895 --> 02:51:47,906
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Dahil sila pong may charge sa ating fisher phone.

1516
02:51:47,916 --> 02:51:53,927
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, so kahit po balik ka ng exercises, would you know kung magkano po yung ginastos dito ng before?

1517
02:51:53,937 --> 02:51:59,948
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hindi ko po matidiscuse yung amounts at based on LGU na cooperation po yun.

1518
02:51:59,958 --> 02:52:05,969
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, Madam Chair, na-raise ko din itong concern na ito kasi out of 6,300 na nangangailangan ng manging isda,

1519
02:52:05,979 --> 02:52:11,990
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa balita po at sabi rin ng mga fisher phone organizations, nasa 226 lang po yung nakatanggap.

1520
02:52:12,000 --> 02:52:19,149
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan, kaya we'll definitely raise this matter before the Department of Agriculture and before.

1521
02:52:19,159 --> 02:52:26,070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi po, ang Pilipinas po pala gumagastos din para po sa sinasagawang balikat ng exercises dito sa bansa.

1522
02:52:26,080 --> 02:52:29,429
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Opo, gumagastos po talaga tayo dahil it's for mutual defense.

1523
02:52:29,439 --> 02:52:33,510
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, so magkano po ang nagastos natin for the year 2025 to 2026?

1524
02:52:33,520 --> 02:52:33,830
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Opo, no.

1525
02:52:33,840 --> 02:52:42,550
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There's a portion there we cannot disclose for operational security because these amounts can be directly tied to activities.

1526
02:52:42,560 --> 02:52:56,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, I hope the representative understands that these are operationally secure matters and part of the exercise is to remain operationally secure.

1527
02:52:56,960 --> 02:52:59,429
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, pero Madam Chair, hindi ba dapat kung...

1528
02:52:59,439 --> 02:53:05,510
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: We have some budget for this and we account to the...

1529
02:53:05,520 --> 02:53:08,862
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: on an operationally secure basis.

1530
02:53:08,872 --> 02:53:10,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, so saan po naka-lodge ang budget na ito?

1531
02:53:11,437 --> 02:53:14,913
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: You said meron po sa BEFAR?

1532
02:53:14,913 --> 02:53:16,415
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sa training.

1533
02:53:16,415 --> 02:53:17,157
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay.

1534
02:53:18,170 --> 02:53:22,355
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, pero bukod po ba sa DA at BEFAR, meron pang ibang mga departments?

1535
02:53:22,355 --> 02:53:22,895
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I would not know.

1536
02:53:22,895 --> 02:53:23,772
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na gumagastos.

1537
02:53:23,840 --> 02:53:25,477
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I would not know.

1538
02:53:25,645 --> 02:53:26,287
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O, sige po.

1539
02:53:26,995 --> 02:53:29,813
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I will raise this before DA.

1540
02:53:30,539 --> 02:53:31,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The Department of Agriculture.

1541
02:53:31,760 --> 02:53:34,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi nasa kanila din po.

1542
02:53:34,000 --> 02:53:38,630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sila po ang magsasama-sama nung mag-discuss atong conclusion.

1543
02:53:38,880 --> 02:53:42,284
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I will register for the round two, Madam Chair.

1544
02:53:42,284 --> 02:53:43,972
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, thank you, Sarah.

1545
02:53:46,030 --> 02:53:53,110
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Next to interpolate from the majority, Representative Leo Rodriguez.

1546
02:53:53,120 --> 02:53:54,383
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1547
02:53:55,600 --> 02:53:57,750
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Good afternoon, Madam Chair.

1548
02:53:57,760 --> 02:54:00,458
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Mr. Secretary, DND family.

1549
02:54:02,160 --> 02:54:05,892
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Madam Chair, under RA-1207,

1550
02:54:07,040 --> 02:54:10,389
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: or the Ligtas Pinoy Center Act,

1551
02:54:10,399 --> 02:54:13,537
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: government is mandated to establish permanent evacuation center

1552
02:54:14,080 --> 02:54:16,152
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: in every city and municipality.

1553
02:54:17,600 --> 02:54:25,940
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: For 2027, 3.06 billion is proposed for 34 Ligtas Pinoy Center,

1554
02:54:26,640 --> 02:54:30,175
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: two per region at 90 million each.

1555
02:54:31,760 --> 02:54:35,830
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: We note that BICOL has been identified as among the most important

1556
02:54:35,840 --> 02:54:44,637
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: areas for the implementation of this program as mentioned by our good President in his recent sona.

1557
02:54:46,007 --> 02:54:52,364
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Inasaan po namin na ito dahil kami ang sumasalubong sa mga paparating na bagyo,

1558
02:54:52,617 --> 02:54:56,368
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: lalo na ngayon na mas nagiging matindi ang mga ito.

1559
02:54:57,243 --> 02:54:59,829
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, malaki po ang may tulong nito sa amin.

1560
02:55:01,520 --> 02:55:04,769
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Provided this, may we ask the OCD,

1561
02:55:06,240 --> 02:55:14,230
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: have the specific sites or priority LGOs for 2027 centers already been identified

1562
02:55:14,240 --> 02:55:19,450
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: and what criteria will be used in selecting them?

1563
02:55:22,799 --> 02:55:24,632
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ito ang problema natin.

1564
02:55:26,033 --> 02:55:31,240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Mabuti na yun, na yung tanong ni Representative Rodriguez ang tanong.

1565
02:55:31,250 --> 02:55:35,886
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kung bawat city, bawat municipality,

1566
02:55:36,425 --> 02:55:37,718
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: e nalubog yung tatlo,

1567
02:55:38,300 --> 02:55:38,796
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sabay-sabay,

1568
02:55:38,990 --> 02:55:42,181
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: papano natin mapapatupad?

1569
02:55:42,720 --> 02:55:48,577
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, pwedeng itayo sa ibang lugar for the benefit of probably the three cities.

1570
02:55:49,654 --> 02:55:51,181
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Nangyayari po yan sa Pangasinan.

1571
02:55:52,089 --> 02:55:53,678
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pagka bumaha yung isa,

1572
02:55:54,792 --> 02:55:58,651
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pagka galing sa southwest ang baha,

1573
02:55:59,456 --> 02:56:01,086
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: lubog ang apat na bayan,

1574
02:56:02,531 --> 02:56:05,110
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: alangan naman dun tayo magtayo.

1575
02:56:05,379 --> 02:56:06,710
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yun po kami nahihirapan.

1576
02:56:06,720 --> 02:56:07,949
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For example, Lindon.

1577
02:56:11,359 --> 02:56:15,239
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pag no construction area, yung 6 kilometer,

1578
02:56:20,018 --> 02:56:25,969
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: at alam niyong lalago pa yung vulkan,

1579
02:56:27,520 --> 02:56:29,954
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: papano niyong patatayuan dun sa bawat municipality and city?

1580
02:56:35,261 --> 02:56:38,791
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, kailangan siguro ng...

1581
02:56:41,120 --> 02:56:45,074
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pag-aaral din sa batas na liwanagin for the benefit of evacuees na i-identify ng DNR

1582
02:56:48,524 --> 02:56:51,100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sa kanilang hazard mapping sa isang lugar,

1583
02:56:51,520 --> 02:56:52,803
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: dun itatayo yung evacuation center sa isang lugar.

1584
02:56:55,489 --> 02:57:00,908
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang problema po, kailangan may consent nung pagtatayuan na munisipyo

1585
02:57:00,918 --> 02:57:04,763
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: dahil magpupuno din siya ng tao na hindi niya kababayan.

1586
02:57:05,760 --> 02:57:07,552
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At least for a temporary basis.

1587
02:57:09,157 --> 02:57:11,760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, alam po natin yung prinsipyo,

1588
02:57:13,102 --> 02:57:15,685
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eto po ang pinagtutuunan ng pansin ngayon.

1589
02:57:16,560 --> 02:57:19,415
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Maybe we can identify certain areas na walang issue.

1590
02:57:21,600 --> 02:57:24,359
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero sa total number of areas,

1591
02:57:25,913 --> 02:57:30,929
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eto po'y magiging function din

1592
02:57:30,939 --> 02:57:34,296
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ng bumabagsak ba yung mga kalye dun sa dalawang munisipyo.

1593
02:57:34,400 --> 02:57:37,913
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kaya kailangan may pre-emptive evacuation, lalo na po sa Katanduanes,

1594
02:57:38,000 --> 02:57:40,188
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hindi ba dun sa eastern portion ninyo, babakwit yan papuntang Badabirak area.

1595
02:57:46,800 --> 02:58:01,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, dito po kami humihingi ng tulong sa inyo at saka po sa DNR na kompleto ang hazard mapping

1596
02:58:03,120 --> 02:58:05,855
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na mag-identify kung saan sensible na magtayo ng evacuation centers depending on the hazard.

1597
02:58:07,001 --> 02:58:07,953
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kung Baguio or Vulcan.

1598
02:58:08,560 --> 02:58:11,238
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Secretary, Madam Chair.

1599
02:58:11,879 --> 02:58:13,489
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, kasi alam niyo naman po yung Katanduanes.

1600
02:58:13,600 --> 02:58:17,461
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, I hope, Madam Chair,

1601
02:58:17,471 --> 02:58:23,371
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: medyo Katanduanes sana itong makonsider na malagyan natin ito

1602
02:58:23,381 --> 02:58:27,723
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: dahil alam niyo naman na talagang kami palagi ang nai-hit ng Baguio,

1603
02:58:27,733 --> 02:58:29,794
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: which is na talagang na-isolate kami,

1604
02:58:30,917 --> 02:58:34,604
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: lalo na pag medyo wala nang...

1605
02:58:35,154 --> 02:58:36,574
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: biyahe.

1606
02:58:37,674 --> 02:58:40,629
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, nahihirap po kami marating kagad.

1607
02:58:40,881 --> 02:58:46,162
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, pag may ganito kami, medyo kahit paano, medyo...

1608
02:58:46,172 --> 02:58:48,875
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: medyo ano naman tayo, secured.

1609
02:58:49,814 --> 02:58:56,309
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Opo, kaya isa yan po sa pinaparating din natin na makonsider po

1610
02:58:56,319 --> 02:58:58,015
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: ang Katanduanes, Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary,

1611
02:59:00,964 --> 02:59:03,785
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: dito po sa programa natin na Ligtas Pinoy Center.

1612
02:59:04,891 --> 02:59:06,458
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, napagaganda po nito ng programo.

1613
02:59:06,937 --> 02:59:14,551
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: ng ating gobyerno, lalo na po doon sa mga talagang madalas mapiktuhan ng kalamidad ng mga probinsya.

1614
02:59:16,560 --> 02:59:17,354
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Madam Chair,

1615
02:59:19,359 --> 02:59:24,442
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: our province, Katanduanes space, the Pacific and firm parts of the Eastern Seaboard,

1616
02:59:25,920 --> 02:59:28,610
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: while our national security discussing...

1617
02:59:30,479 --> 02:59:31,175
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: discussion under...

1618
02:59:31,677 --> 02:59:32,389
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: under standard bill,

1619
02:59:32,399 --> 02:59:39,590
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: will be focused on the West Philippines,

1620
02:59:39,600 --> 02:59:41,772
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: since we as DND mayroon po ba tayong sapat na surveillance o monitoring

1621
02:59:42,857 --> 02:59:46,569
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: sa Eastern Sea, seaside ng bansa at sa mga area malapit sa Katanduanes,

1622
02:59:47,343 --> 02:59:49,613
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: paano natin sinisecure ang Eastern Seaboards in among specific...

1623
02:59:50,240 --> 02:59:54,209
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: specific investment sa ilalim ng 2027 budget at AP modernization program

1624
03:00:02,319 --> 03:00:04,790
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: ang nakatoon sa pagpapalakas ng ating radar communication in the air and naval presence.

1625
03:00:07,840 --> 03:00:13,278
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Kasi po, noong mga previous years, may mga nakakapasok po sa amin,

1626
03:00:15,200 --> 03:00:21,030
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: ang mga foreign vessels na minsan hindi natin namumonitor, Madam Chair.

1627
03:00:21,218 --> 03:00:28,551
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po yan patuloy doon sa domain awareness ng mga budget natin,

1628
03:00:28,561 --> 03:00:32,744
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pero malaking tulong po dyan yung mga bagong vessel ng Philippine Coast Guard

1629
03:00:32,754 --> 03:00:38,870
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na makakakuha po sila ng karagdagan na maya-assign na rin doon sa mga lugar ninyo

1630
03:00:38,880 --> 03:00:40,497
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na maaring mag-increase po ng vigilance doon sa area.

1631
03:00:50,160 --> 03:00:53,861
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Admitido po tayo doon sa eastern seaboard, medyo kulang po talaga ang ating existing infrastructure,

1632
03:00:53,871 --> 03:00:54,711
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ngunit nakaprograma po.

1633
03:00:54,720 --> 03:00:58,047
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ako sa atin na yung domain awareness at least doon sa eastern seaboard matatagdagan po.

1634
03:01:04,319 --> 03:01:11,598
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Madam Chair, actually, we raised a similar concern during the agency budget deliberation last year.

1635
03:01:12,399 --> 03:01:15,277
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Alam to ni Secretary, we received response from the good Secretary

1636
03:01:16,080 --> 03:01:22,220
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: that they will study our proposal of establishing a naval base in the province of Catanduan

1637
03:01:23,040 --> 03:01:25,823
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: to provide support in patrolling the eastern seaboard.

1638
03:01:26,880 --> 03:01:33,923
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: We hope the ND can also provide us with the updates of this possibility of this request.

1639
03:01:37,439 --> 03:01:38,902
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, sa kalaman lang po, Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary,

1640
03:01:40,260 --> 03:01:42,544
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: yung pinatayo po natin doon na structure para doon sa Philippine Coast Guard,

1641
03:01:42,630 --> 03:01:43,413
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: yun po ay natapos na.

1642
03:01:43,520 --> 03:01:48,301
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, the Philippine Coast Guard are planning to medyo magamit na po nila yun

1643
03:01:49,359 --> 03:01:55,176
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: sa siguro ito, isang bagay ito na makakatulong po doon sa...

1644
03:01:55,315 --> 03:02:03,923
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: ...Lorana Station po doon sa barangadong po sa munisipalidad po ng Bagamanok.

1645
03:02:05,040 --> 03:02:06,900
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Madam Secretary, ay Madam Chair.

1646
03:02:08,033 --> 03:02:12,928
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sa ngayon po, ang kasi requirements ng Coast Guard, iba po sa amin.

1647
03:02:13,171 --> 03:02:18,166
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Mas malaki po yung kailangan namin at mas malalaki po ang mga barko na pumapasok.

1648
03:02:20,189 --> 03:02:25,043
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang report sa akin po ng FOIC, maraming claimants doon sa area.

1649
03:02:26,924 --> 03:02:30,059
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang alawa po, ang pinakamalaking problema, nakita naman po natin kanina,

1650
03:02:30,160 --> 03:02:31,535
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: yung capital outlay budget natin binawasan.

1651
03:02:33,931 --> 03:02:38,465
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, paano po tayo magproceed kung gano'n?

1652
03:02:41,273 --> 03:02:47,411
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Bagamat gano'n, baka magtulungan na lang po kami sa Coast Guard.

1653
03:02:48,414 --> 03:02:56,478
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pag-usapan na lang po namin kung paano kami makapagtulungan sa kanila.

1654
03:02:57,040 --> 03:03:01,741
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Based on yung capabilities namin na makakapasok sa mainland po ng Bicol.

1655
03:03:08,399 --> 03:03:10,128
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1656
03:03:11,600 --> 03:03:25,510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: So, yung ano naman po, Madam Chair, yung sa lupa naman po doon, alam ko naman na okay naman po, Mr. Secretary.

1657
03:03:25,520 --> 03:03:26,463
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Philippine Coast Guard.

1658
03:03:26,507 --> 03:03:28,912
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Alam naman tayong problema doon.

1659
03:03:30,160 --> 03:03:38,748
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Anyway, thank you po, Madam Secretary, Madam Chair and Mr. Secretary, sa napawaganda mong kasagutan.

1660
03:03:41,809 --> 03:03:47,934
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Alam ko naman na hindi mo papabaya ng katanduanis dahil isa yun po sa talagang dapat protektan din naman natin.

1661
03:03:48,513 --> 03:03:52,775
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Dahil nandoon nga kami sa, ikang malapit kami sa Binham Rice.

1662
03:03:53,479 --> 03:03:54,969
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Salamat po. Salamat po.

1663
03:03:55,279 --> 03:03:56,112
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Kong Leo.

1664
03:03:58,479 --> 03:04:00,790
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Next to interpolate from the minority.

1665
03:04:00,800 --> 03:04:01,867
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Representative Elijah San Fernando.

1666
03:04:02,960 --> 03:04:05,030
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1667
03:04:05,040 --> 03:04:08,230
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, good morning po.

1668
03:04:08,240 --> 03:04:12,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: It is the duty of the state to protect its citizens at all times.

1669
03:04:12,160 --> 03:04:15,190
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ito po ang state policy natin, Mr. Secretary. Tama po ba?

1670
03:04:15,200 --> 03:04:17,110
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Oh, yeah.

1671
03:04:17,120 --> 03:04:25,990
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, to protect effectively, ang ibig sabihin po nito, our men in uniform must be well-equipped and well-rationed po, Mr. Secretary.

1672
03:04:26,000 --> 03:04:27,269
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

1673
03:04:27,279 --> 03:04:30,230
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And being well-equipped and well-rationed.

1674
03:04:30,240 --> 03:04:33,590
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, means being able to provide for our own.

1675
03:04:33,600 --> 03:04:34,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po, Mr. Secretary.

1676
03:04:34,960 --> 03:04:36,469
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Not necessarily, Your Honor.

1677
03:04:36,479 --> 03:04:39,510
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We provide in several ways.

1678
03:04:39,520 --> 03:04:41,670
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of course, that's part of resilience.

1679
03:04:41,680 --> 03:04:46,389
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But the reality of the situation is worldwide.

1680
03:04:46,399 --> 03:04:53,590
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are defined supply chains for specific items of need.

1681
03:04:53,600 --> 03:04:58,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We should provide for our own when we can.

1682
03:04:58,080 --> 03:04:59,510
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1683
03:04:59,520 --> 03:05:01,830
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, in the PDP midterm update,

1684
03:05:01,840 --> 03:05:10,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, the Philippine Development Plan is the plan upon which all plans of all departments must be anchored upon.

1685
03:05:10,160 --> 03:05:24,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In Chapter 13.1, Outcome No. 4, it says that one of the outcome indicators is to develop a modern, credible, self-reliant defense force.

1686
03:05:24,960 --> 03:05:31,429
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, can you discuss what is the operational definition of self-reliance?

1687
03:05:31,439 --> 03:05:41,910
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is to secure your supply chains for the most expeditious and cost-effective means possible.

1688
03:05:41,920 --> 03:05:45,990
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We know it cannot be totally indigenous.

1689
03:05:46,000 --> 03:05:49,510
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Self-reliance does not mean indigenous.

1690
03:05:49,520 --> 03:05:56,550
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It means securing your supply chains on the most favorable of terms and at the least lead time possible.

1691
03:05:56,560 --> 03:06:02,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, it doesn't necessarily mean, Mr. Secretary, na tayo lang.

1692
03:06:02,160 --> 03:06:04,230
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, as much as possible, if we can acquire it.

1693
03:06:04,240 --> 03:06:09,830
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's called import substitution already, which is different from self-reliance.

1694
03:06:09,840 --> 03:06:22,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because, I mean, as I made an example earlier, there was a program during the 70s, although it was cut short,

1695
03:06:22,080 --> 03:06:26,870
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: where, knowing fully well, there was a lack of grazing land in the Philippines.

1696
03:06:26,880 --> 03:06:30,630
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It would be cheaper to buy land in other countries.

1697
03:06:30,640 --> 03:06:31,910
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Which were...

1698
03:06:31,920 --> 03:06:36,230
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Lightly populated, grow the cattle there for the Philippine cattle industry.

1699
03:06:36,240 --> 03:06:47,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, although the activity is somewhere else, the beneficiary being in this country, that is a way of resilience too.

1700
03:06:47,359 --> 03:06:55,269
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, for us, it's to get what we need at the speediest possible time and on an evolutionary basis.

1701
03:06:55,279 --> 03:06:57,990
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary. I'll get back to that point po.

1702
03:06:58,000 --> 03:07:03,269
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, in your NEP po, Mr. Secretary,

1703
03:07:03,279 --> 03:07:10,070
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dito po sa government arsenal, nabawasan po ng 21.8% yung budget.

1704
03:07:10,080 --> 03:07:18,870
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Can you enlighten the committee as to why the budget for government arsenal was reduced by 21.8%?

1705
03:07:18,880 --> 03:07:24,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Capital outlay, Your Honor, for structures and facilities.

1706
03:07:24,080 --> 03:07:27,510
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we already have a new roadmap for the government arsenal.

1707
03:07:27,520 --> 03:07:33,429
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It being a sovereign enterprise, just like the Philippine mint.

1708
03:07:33,439 --> 03:07:34,790
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Central bank mint.

1709
03:07:34,800 --> 03:07:45,110
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And so, the future activity will be to concentrate not on small arms but on something else.

1710
03:07:45,120 --> 03:07:46,230
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1711
03:07:46,240 --> 03:07:58,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: On the first quarter target po, or output, ang nakasulat po dito sa 2026 target is we need to produce 60 million rounds of ammunition.

1712
03:07:58,960 --> 03:08:02,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The actual output is only...

1713
03:08:02,160 --> 03:08:03,429
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Only 500,000.

1714
03:08:03,439 --> 03:08:08,070
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Can you enlighten the committee as to bakit po ganito kababa?

1715
03:08:08,080 --> 03:08:11,269
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's the market sourcing for precursors, Your Honor.

1716
03:08:11,279 --> 03:08:13,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is a worldwide shortage right now.

1717
03:08:13,040 --> 03:08:15,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's a supplier's market.

1718
03:08:15,040 --> 03:08:19,990
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, where do we usually get these precursors, Mr. Secretary?

1719
03:08:20,000 --> 03:08:22,230
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Depends, Your Honor, on the availability.

1720
03:08:22,240 --> 03:08:31,429
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We can get from the United States, we can get from South Africa, we can get from Brazil and other countries, which are very few.

1721
03:08:31,439 --> 03:08:38,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because these are nitrocellulose.

1722
03:08:38,960 --> 03:08:44,469
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it's a seller's market.

1723
03:08:44,479 --> 03:08:48,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1724
03:08:48,960 --> 03:08:54,250
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dito po sa Rule 4, Section 1F ng SRDP Revitalization Act,

1725
03:08:54,560 --> 03:09:02,389
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: any foreign procurement must include a mandatory understudy program to train Filipino workers and secure technology transfer.

1726
03:09:02,399 --> 03:09:05,670
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Of the multi-billion peso contracts in the 2027 program of DND,

1727
03:09:05,680 --> 03:09:16,630
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ilan po dito yung mga contract na merong audited, binding, understudy programs and tech transfer clauses?

1728
03:09:16,640 --> 03:09:22,550
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are no new 2027 contracts except very few, Your Honor.

1729
03:09:22,560 --> 03:09:31,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And as I said earlier, that law is unworkable unless you spend for R&amp;D and for...

1730
03:09:31,359 --> 03:09:33,349
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ah...

1731
03:09:33,359 --> 03:09:38,790
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Equity in order to have a share of the intellectual property rights.

1732
03:09:38,800 --> 03:09:46,309
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: You have to invest on the risk side, on the R&amp;D side to benefit from the upside.

1733
03:09:46,319 --> 03:09:52,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Or else you'll not get any viable self-reliance program whatsoever.

1734
03:09:52,160 --> 03:09:57,110
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the most important thing is you share in the intellectual property rights.

1735
03:09:57,120 --> 03:10:00,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's the crown jewel of everything.

1736
03:10:00,160 --> 03:10:01,750
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1737
03:10:01,760 --> 03:10:03,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Chair, kaya ko po

1738
03:10:03,160 --> 03:10:04,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tinanong itong mga tanong ko.

1739
03:10:04,960 --> 03:10:11,110
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Because it is in my position that defense also has something to do with industrial policy.

1740
03:10:11,120 --> 03:10:18,309
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: For us to be able to defend ourselves and for us to have an effective defense plan,

1741
03:10:18,319 --> 03:10:21,110
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: we must have an industrial policy.

1742
03:10:21,120 --> 03:10:22,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Definitely, Your Honor.

1743
03:10:22,160 --> 03:10:27,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it means that being able to produce for our own, being able to equip our own.

1744
03:10:27,040 --> 03:10:32,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, Mr. Secretary, what is your comment about the statement of...

1745
03:10:32,960 --> 03:10:35,429
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ...Secretary Arsenio Balisacan?

1746
03:10:35,439 --> 03:10:43,030
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Wherein he said that we do not need to do or we don't have to do industrial policy like what our neighbors did.

1747
03:10:43,040 --> 03:10:47,110
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And this is in line with the PDP, the Philippine Development Plan,

1748
03:10:47,120 --> 03:10:56,710
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: wherein one of the outcome indicators says that we must develop our self-reliant defense force.

1749
03:10:56,720 --> 03:11:01,030
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, probably what he means is that you don't need to reinvent the wheel

1750
03:11:01,040 --> 03:11:04,790
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: if you can get the technology.

1751
03:11:04,800 --> 03:11:10,469
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But there are some immutables, that there are some basics that you need to remediate.

1752
03:11:10,479 --> 03:11:19,510
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ease of doing business, transaction costs, administrative costs, connectivity and power.

1753
03:11:19,520 --> 03:11:29,990
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Unless you lower these costs, then any industrial activity is a value proposition

1754
03:11:30,000 --> 03:11:32,950
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: that must have a positive outcome indicator.

1755
03:11:32,960 --> 03:11:39,110
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If not, it will be a sunk cost that will be marginal for any country.

1756
03:11:39,120 --> 03:11:42,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Unless it's a public good.

1757
03:11:42,080 --> 03:11:47,750
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That, for example, a railroad, which doesn't make money.

1758
03:11:47,760 --> 03:11:55,670
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, maybe the statement of Secretary Balisacan is that it's useless to reinvent things

1759
03:11:55,680 --> 03:12:02,550
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: that we can have with partnerships or with sustainable like-minded...

1760
03:12:02,560 --> 03:12:12,070
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ...co-venturing and place what you can value-add based on your own characteristics to the initiative.

1761
03:12:12,080 --> 03:12:18,389
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But nonetheless, there is no input without an output.

1762
03:12:18,399 --> 03:12:19,910
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

1763
03:12:19,920 --> 03:12:24,230
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: As you can see, I'm a supporter of industrial policy.

1764
03:12:24,240 --> 03:12:25,510
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I definitely support it.

1765
03:12:25,520 --> 03:12:30,526
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: All of the problems that we are facing now, like high electricity costs, etc.,

1766
03:12:30,536 --> 03:12:34,550
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hinarap din po kasi ito ng mga problema ng mga kapitbahay natin.

1767
03:12:34,560 --> 03:12:40,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: We have South Korea, we have Taiwan, we have Vietnam, even China, say, for example.

1768
03:12:40,160 --> 03:12:49,590
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But their economic managers have that ambition to really develop their industries.

1769
03:12:49,600 --> 03:12:58,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: My point here, Madam Chair and Mr. Secretary, again, for us to have an effective defense plan

1770
03:12:58,160 --> 03:13:02,710
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and for us to really do what is written in the Constitution

1771
03:13:02,720 --> 03:13:05,429
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: to protect our people at all times,

1772
03:13:05,439 --> 03:13:14,389
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: industrial policy is a must so that in times of war, say, for example,

1773
03:13:14,399 --> 03:13:16,104
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: or nagkaroon naman mga challenging times,

1774
03:13:16,114 --> 03:13:22,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung hindi man makapag-provide yung mga pinagkukunan natin ng mga precursors, materials, etc.,

1775
03:13:22,160 --> 03:13:30,150
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at least we can say that we can provide for our own and we can equip our men in uniform.

1776
03:13:30,160 --> 03:13:33,670
