DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to the Department of National Defense.

3395
05:12:48,000 --> 05:12:49,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, yes.

3396
05:12:49,040 --> 05:12:51,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And as I understand,

3397
05:12:51,040 --> 05:12:53,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: this is now the subject of

3398
05:12:53,440 --> 05:12:56,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung raid dun sa

3399
05:12:56,240 --> 05:12:59,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: parang Chinese steel company?

3400
05:12:59,840 --> 05:13:00,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

3401
05:13:00,400 --> 05:13:02,352
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's Sanja Steel.

3402
05:13:02,352 --> 05:13:03,336
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

3403
05:13:03,336 --> 05:13:04,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes.

3404
05:13:04,320 --> 05:13:06,958
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This is now the subject of a heated...

3405
05:13:06,958 --> 05:13:08,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Was owned by...

3406
05:13:08,080 --> 05:13:09,450
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Is owned by Tony Yang.

3407
05:13:09,450 --> 05:13:10,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

3408
05:13:10,240 --> 05:13:13,050
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Who is under detention right now.

3409
05:13:13,050 --> 05:13:14,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Tama po. Oo.

3410
05:13:14,320 --> 05:13:15,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This is the sub...

3411
05:13:15,200 --> 05:13:18,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Has been the subject of parang a heated exchange

3412
05:13:18,160 --> 05:13:20,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: between the DND

3413
05:13:20,000 --> 05:13:21,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the Chinese Embassy.

3414
05:13:21,840 --> 05:13:22,718
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

3415
05:13:22,718 --> 05:13:28,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And let me just say na

3416
05:13:28,240 --> 05:13:30,785
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pambihira din yung Chinese Embassy dahi nga

3417
05:13:30,785 --> 05:13:32,513
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tuloy-tuloy ang

3418
05:13:32,513 --> 05:13:34,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagpapahayag niya

3419
05:13:34,240 --> 05:13:35,147
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: regarding, of course,

3420
05:13:35,147 --> 05:13:37,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the baseless claims of China

3421
05:13:37,680 --> 05:13:41,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of sovereignty over the West Philippine Sea.

3422
05:13:41,040 --> 05:13:42,045
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Okay.

3423
05:13:42,045 --> 05:13:46,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ngayon, kaugnay dito sa issue na to,

3424
05:13:46,080 --> 05:13:48,664
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: apparently, ang context pala nito

3425
05:13:48,664 --> 05:13:52,638
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay magde-develop

3426
05:13:52,638 --> 05:13:53,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang AFP

3427
05:13:53,440 --> 05:13:55,308
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or is it the DND

3428
05:13:55,308 --> 05:13:57,176
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng dry dock

3429
05:13:57,176 --> 05:13:59,044
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa Tagaloan.

3430
05:13:59,044 --> 05:14:00,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan lang po.

3431
05:14:00,000 --> 05:14:01,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I suppose, bahagi nun yung...

3432
05:14:01,280 --> 05:14:05,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pag-secure ng area

3433
05:14:05,680 --> 05:14:09,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and, of course,

3434
05:14:09,600 --> 05:14:12,958
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung merong Chinese company na nandun,

3435
05:14:12,958 --> 05:14:15,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tama po ba that is considered a threat

3436
05:14:15,120 --> 05:14:18,395
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to the security of the facility?

3437
05:14:18,395 --> 05:14:20,560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Isa na po yun.

3438
05:14:20,560 --> 05:14:23,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we cannot allow any attached agency

3439
05:14:23,360 --> 05:14:25,484
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to be used improperly.

3440
05:14:25,484 --> 05:14:30,854
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi ito po ay niliwanag po ng PAOC.

3441
05:14:30,854 --> 05:14:31,895
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: No?

3442
05:14:31,895 --> 05:14:35,101
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Bagamat Chinese yung kumpanya,

3443
05:14:35,101 --> 05:14:38,307
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hindi basta-basta ito mati-disrupt

3444
05:14:38,307 --> 05:14:41,513
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: or kung gumagawa ng legal,

3445
05:14:41,513 --> 05:14:44,719
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eh illegal po yung nangyayari.

3446
05:14:44,719 --> 05:14:45,760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Talamak na...

3447
05:14:45,760 --> 05:14:56,949
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Talamak na iligal. So much so that there is a million tons of ore in the area now which we need to dispose of.

3448
05:14:56,949 --> 05:15:08,958
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pinapasok po nila ang substandard material, nilulusaw po nila ito at binibenta na rebars sa lugar na prone nga sa lindol.

3449
05:15:08,958 --> 05:15:13,600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So ito'y nakapipinsala sa community. Among other violations, Your Honor, no?

3450
05:15:13,600 --> 05:15:23,680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So much so that the ECC was cancelled and there was a cease and desist order issued by DNR.

3451
05:15:23,680 --> 05:15:26,145
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ang sinasabi nyo may legal basis?

3452
05:15:26,145 --> 05:15:38,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po. Kasi po bago po ito sinalakay ng NBI, may search warrant po na kinuha sa isang judge.

3453
05:15:38,080 --> 05:15:42,480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of course, the process of, uh, uh, uh, securing a search warrant.

3454
05:15:42,480 --> 05:15:57,200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The search warrant needs, uh, personal examination of witnesses.

3455
05:15:57,200 --> 05:16:01,280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ayon po sa NBI, nag-test-buy pa nga po sila ng produkto at ito'y lumalabas na labag sa Philippine standards po.

3456
05:16:01,280 --> 05:16:07,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Could you elaborate on the plans regarding the development of the area as a dry dock?

3457
05:16:07,360 --> 05:16:11,959
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At kasama ba ito sa budget proposal and what is the timeline?

3458
05:16:11,969 --> 05:16:27,072
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kailangan po siya sa budget proposal pero kailangan po natin dahil ang dry dock po ng Philippine Navy ngayon ay nasa Sangli, Fort San Felipe po.

3459
05:16:28,287 --> 05:16:35,122
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ito'y mababaw na mababaw na po, hindi mapasukan ng mga barko natin na atin.

3460
05:16:35,982 --> 05:16:46,900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So kailangan po natin dahil may papadating po tayo na 6 hanggang 8 na barko, wala na po siyang pag-aayusan.

3461
05:16:47,879 --> 05:16:49,820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So ang mangyayari po dito?

3462
05:16:50,275 --> 05:16:59,303
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So kung walang dry dock, maliban pa po sa ibang equipment, ilalabas po natin for maintenance, kailangan po natin ito para ma-maintain yung fleet natin.

3463
05:16:59,911 --> 05:17:05,767
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ito'y solely Philippine Navy use at pagka nakuha na natin po yung titulo dahil dapat i-separate po ito sa Phoebe Deck area, popondohan na po.

3464
05:17:06,593 --> 05:17:10,036
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So ano ang timeframe po ng pag-develop nito?

3465
05:17:10,036 --> 05:17:11,673
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: As soon as possible.

3466
05:17:12,027 --> 05:17:15,132
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Oo po, dahil nauuna na po yung equipment kesa sa dry dock eh.

3467
05:17:15,672 --> 05:17:29,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ang sinasabi nyo ba ay basically ay aabondanahin na ng Navy ang Sangli dry dock?

3468
05:17:29,520 --> 05:17:41,328
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Oo po, dahil ito po ay magiging international airport na po as a, para po sa domestic flights din na hindi na kakayanin ng naiya.

3469
05:17:41,328 --> 05:17:44,396
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Secondly po, talagang mababaw na po ang Sangli.

3470
05:17:44,396 --> 05:17:49,676
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pangalawag, para pumasok po sa Sangli, marami pong baklad na iiwasan.

3471
05:17:49,676 --> 05:17:52,798
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So hindi na po sustainable ang Sangli.

3472
05:17:52,798 --> 05:18:06,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ito pong Sangli ay designed para sa mas maliit na mga sasakyang pandagat, hindi po designed sa lalim na kailangan pong i-service ang Philippine Navy vessels.

3473
05:18:06,160 --> 05:18:09,107
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

3474
05:18:09,107 --> 05:18:09,607
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

3475
05:18:09,607 --> 05:18:10,494
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So,

3476
05:18:10,494 --> 05:18:11,818
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ngayon,

3477
05:18:11,818 --> 05:18:17,754
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang tanong po natin ngayon ay,

3478
05:18:17,754 --> 05:18:18,975
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang nagkukomplika dito,

3479
05:18:18,975 --> 05:18:22,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung reports kaugnay sa Tagaloan or FIVIDEC,

3480
05:18:22,000 --> 05:18:26,958
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na merong US soldiers na nagtangkang pumasok pero hindi sila nakapasok.

3481
05:18:26,958 --> 05:18:34,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And this was noted in a police blotter of the PNP as well as acknowledged by the US Embassy.

3482
05:18:34,480 --> 05:18:39,238
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ano po ang interest ng US sa FIVIDEC?

3483
05:18:39,238 --> 05:18:39,893
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Last year,

3484
05:18:39,893 --> 05:18:44,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nagkaroon po tayo ng balikatan activity doon sa area.

3485
05:18:44,320 --> 05:18:52,836
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So this year, kaugnay po ng hindi po solely US yun, may kasama din pong,

3486
05:18:52,836 --> 05:19:05,280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ano na, tawag nito, 4th Infantry Division, hindi lang nagkaroon ng coordination doon sa area.

3487
05:19:05,280 --> 05:19:13,683
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi hindi po pwedeng magamit yung PBDEC mismo kasi hindi po environmentally cleared ng DNR yung area.

3488
05:19:13,683 --> 05:19:15,430
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Malamang nag-a-access lang po sila.

3489
05:19:15,430 --> 05:19:16,862
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Nag-a-access lang po sila para makita yung bay.

3490
05:19:16,862 --> 05:19:22,320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero ganun pa man, hindi sila pinayagan ng Philippine Army na pumasok dahil sa lack of coordination.

3491
05:19:22,320 --> 05:19:27,760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At mahigpit po yung bilin sa Philippine Army dahil po the area is not environmentally cleared by PNRI and DENR.

3492
05:19:27,760 --> 05:19:35,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We cannot take the risk of people going in there and getting whatever—uh, whatever disease.

3493
05:19:35,920 --> 05:19:39,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ano pong interest ng US military sa area na yun?

3494
05:19:39,840 --> 05:19:45,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Do they also want to have access or use to the facilities that will be put up?

3495
05:19:45,680 --> 05:19:48,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That is purely balikatan, Your Honor.

3496
05:19:48,060 --> 05:19:48,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Balikatan?

3497
05:19:48,560 --> 05:19:51,864
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yeah, a loading exercise which happened last year.

3498
05:19:51,864 --> 05:19:58,191
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero posible rin po na gamitin ng US Navy kung sakaling maitayo na yung dry dock, pwede rin nilang gamitin?

3499
05:19:58,191 --> 05:20:02,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sa atin lang po puno na yun eh. Kaya kailangan din na po natin.

3500
05:20:02,400 --> 05:20:06,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So I don't see any space for expansion on that area.

3501
05:20:06,400 --> 05:20:09,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So you do not see that it is?

3502
05:20:09,360 --> 05:20:13,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: No, Your Honor. We need to have our own dedicated dry dock actually.

3503
05:20:13,360 --> 05:20:21,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Ngayon, yugnay ko na po sa Pax Silica.

3504
05:20:21,280 --> 05:20:29,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Nabanggit nyo kanina na hindi kayo directly involved dyan.

3505
05:20:29,680 --> 05:20:38,878
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero yung Pax Silica, as the US explains it, this has to do with securing the defense industrial base of the US.

3506
05:20:38,878 --> 05:20:39,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung kanilang supply chain.

3507
05:20:39,920 --> 05:20:50,638
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Lalo na for semiconductors, especially given the importance of AI in economic as well as military competition with China.

3508
05:20:50,638 --> 05:21:04,718
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So merong Pax Silica sa New Clark City. Magtatayo daw ng manufacturing facilities.

3509
05:21:04,718 --> 05:21:12,138
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bukod doon, nage-expand ang US ng kanyang not just military but also civilian or dual-use presence.

3510
05:21:12,638 --> 05:21:16,878
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So halimbawa yung Subic, regular na ginagamit ng US Navy for repairs.

3511
05:21:16,878 --> 05:21:28,813
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung recent na destroyer ng US na nawala ng kuryente for four days in the South China Sea, dinala yan sa Subic.

3512
05:21:28,813 --> 05:21:43,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa Mindanao, sa Davao Gulf, magtatayo daw ng oil depot ang US para sa kanila, sa US Navy.

3513
05:21:43,040 --> 05:21:58,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito po ang tanong ko. Kasi Pax Silica, data and so on. Pinakita po sa gera sa Iran that in the 21st century, with the use of drones and missiles,

3514
05:21:58,240 --> 05:22:18,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay pinakita ng Iran na winasak niya yung US Navy base in Bahrain, yung Manama base, kaya namumuroblema yung mga aircraft carrier nila ngayon.

3515
05:22:18,240 --> 05:22:30,307
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi masuplayan. Inataki din ng Iran, di lang yung mga military bases ng US, kung hindi pati yung mga commercial facilities ng US in the area.

3516
05:22:30,500 --> 05:22:47,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For example, yung mga data centers ng Amazon at saka ng Oracle in places like UAE and Kuwait.

3517
05:22:47,360 --> 05:22:52,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang tanong ay, napakaraming mga pasilidad natin ngayon na may presensya ng US, both military and civilian.

3518
05:22:52,160 --> 05:23:09,085
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Subic, yung Davao possibly, and itong New Clark City. Ngayon, kung sakaling magkaroon ng gera sa pagitan ng US at China,

3519
05:23:09,085 --> 05:23:19,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa issue ng Taiwan, pwede po nating mahiduha na tatarget, katulad ng ginawa ng Iran sa Middle East,

3520
05:23:19,120 --> 05:23:31,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay tatargetin ng China ang mga pasilidad, both military as well as commercial, ng US sa Pilipinas.

3521
05:23:31,440 --> 05:23:40,878
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ang concern po natin, yung mga presensya ng US sa Pilipinas ay nasa mga strategic and critical economic.

3522
05:23:40,878 --> 05:23:51,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yung mga infrastructure natin, Subic, New Clark City, ay yung planong joint ammunition facility sa, I think also Subic,

3523
05:23:51,680 --> 05:23:58,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: between the US and the Philippine Armed Forces, Davao possibly kung mayroong fuel depot doon.

3524
05:23:58,480 --> 05:24:08,878
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So in other words, pwedeng maging target ito. It is logical to assume na yan ang unang-unang tatargetin.

3525
05:24:09,700 --> 05:24:15,539
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng China kung sakaling magkaroon ng gera with the US.

3526
05:24:16,349 --> 05:24:21,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The question here is, ano ang kakayahan ng armed forces na depensahan ang mga pasilidad na ito?

3527
05:24:21,040 --> 05:24:24,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi ang nangyari in the Gulf, in the Middle East, ay nawasak po yun.

3528
05:24:24,560 --> 05:24:34,101
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: There is huge economic damage to the economies of the Gulf.

3529
05:24:34,101 --> 05:24:35,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sila mayamang bansa.

3530
05:24:35,440 --> 05:24:39,724
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: High-tech missile defenses.

3531
05:24:39,724 --> 05:24:42,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano po ang Pilipinas?

3532
05:24:42,080 --> 05:24:52,158
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, at risk ang mga buhay ng Pilipino at ang ekonomiya ng Pilipinas

3533
05:24:52,158 --> 05:24:58,983
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil sa lumalawak na presensya ng US at lalo pang lalawak, halimbawa kung matuloy ang Paxilica.

3534
05:24:58,983 --> 05:25:05,830
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, di ba pinag-iisipan ito ng DND?

3535
05:25:05,830 --> 05:25:11,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At paano mapoprotektahan?

3536
05:25:11,280 --> 05:25:18,878
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sa laban po ng marami sa katanungan, I understand the point of the representative.

3537
05:25:18,878 --> 05:25:21,680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: First, doon po sa hinggil sa China threat.

3538
05:25:21,680 --> 05:25:30,701
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Whether or not meron tayong mga alyansa, kalinsabay ng Amerika bilang treaty partner,

3539
05:25:30,701 --> 05:25:36,947
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: may overt acts na po ang China na may balakin sila sa atin.

3540
05:25:36,947 --> 05:25:38,616
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Lately nga po.

3541
05:25:38,616 --> 05:25:52,190
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang kanilang statement na gagawa sila ng maritime observatory sa Scarborough, sa Bajo de Masinloc

3542
05:25:52,190 --> 05:25:56,878
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na maliwanag po, wala silang karapatan.

3543
05:25:56,878 --> 05:26:02,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ang pagtatawag nga po nila ng island, Tau is island, dito sa Seoul,

3544
05:26:02,080 --> 05:26:05,672
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: maybe presages, pre-messages an intention to fortify it.

3545
05:26:05,682 --> 05:26:07,336
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Just like they did in Mischief Reef.

3546
05:26:10,070 --> 05:26:20,934
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, given that, may choice po tayo na itutuloy po ng China ang kanilang ginagawa na wala tayong gagawin

3547
05:26:20,934 --> 05:26:23,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: or kukuha tayo ng kaalyado.

3548
05:26:23,360 --> 05:26:27,600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang sagdanang amin po sa DND, the more we can do resilience with as many partners as possible

3549
05:26:27,600 --> 05:26:34,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: in the quickest amount of time, given the fact na assumption po namin na may balak ang China

3550
05:26:34,400 --> 05:26:42,375
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because geographically,

3551
05:26:42,385 --> 05:26:47,060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang Pilipinas lang ang tanging hadlang sa China, sa Pacific Ocean.

3552
05:26:47,330 --> 05:26:56,638
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Secondly, kahit na po sa Pacific Islands, nababahala na rin po ang dati nga na nakikipag-ayos sa kanila,

3553
05:26:56,638 --> 05:27:05,280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Solomon Islands, na nagpabagsak sila ng ballistic missile doon na may kukunting warning.

3554
05:27:05,280 --> 05:27:08,742
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pati po Australia and New Zealand,

3555
05:27:08,742 --> 05:27:16,317
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na napakalayo na po, ay nababahala din kasi ang supply chains nila na-threaten

3556
05:27:16,317 --> 05:27:23,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: at ang activities ng China doon sa lugar na yon ay patent.

3557
05:27:23,920 --> 05:27:36,878
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, alam ko po yung punto ng ating congressman na will the alliances presage or be a precursor to a Chinese attack.

3558
05:27:36,878 --> 05:27:37,520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I believe.

3559
05:27:37,520 --> 05:27:44,958
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That since China has already by overt action its intention to the Philippines,

3560
05:27:44,958 --> 05:27:51,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's beside the point already, it's either you be co-opted or not.

3561
05:27:51,120 --> 05:28:01,440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Now, to build defense resilience, we know that it is a very expensive proposition and growing more expensive every day.

3562
05:28:01,440 --> 05:28:07,600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Which is why also countries like Australia and Japan,

3563
05:28:07,600 --> 05:28:29,520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and South Korea for that matter and Canada as distant as that feel that their supply chains are threatened and France as distant as that and India for that matter who although pound for pound they can match the People's Liberation Army,

3564
05:28:29,520 --> 05:28:38,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: there is still a lot of shall we say,

3565
05:28:38,080 --> 05:29:01,638
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: defense spending going on in there because of their neighbors that are also being accommodated within that axis.

3566
05:29:01,638 --> 05:29:02,638
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So,

3567
05:29:02,638 --> 05:29:07,277
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sa akin pong palagay ang pagpapalawak ng alyansa at pagdedevelop ng más resilient supply chain lalo na sa critical technologies

3568
05:29:07,277 --> 05:29:08,458
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na,

3569
05:29:08,458 --> 05:29:08,958
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nga,

3570
05:29:08,958 --> 05:29:33,600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I really am not familiar with the corporate workings of Paxilica but the end product we need and we need the supply chain as fast as possible because the experience has it in combat areas, they need to retool this every three days and perhaps even faster with AI.

3571
05:29:33,600 --> 05:29:43,840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's either we adopt the technology and try to use it as best as possible as we can or be taken over.

3572
05:29:43,840 --> 05:29:48,958
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: taken over by the technology without anything happening.

3573
05:29:48,958 --> 05:29:59,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So I know it is a debate which there is – there are concerns, however, in view of the fact

3574
05:29:59,120 --> 05:30:08,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: that we see the – and not only us, even Vietnam sees it, even other countries see

3575
05:30:08,080 --> 05:30:11,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the expansion of China.

3576
05:30:11,120 --> 05:30:28,878
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And given the fact that we have already tried the latest attempt, ang latest pagsubok yung

3577
05:30:28,878 --> 05:30:36,592
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pag-file natin ng delineation ng ating maritime waters sa ITLOS under the UN, eh dito naman

3578
05:30:36,592 --> 05:30:38,080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: tayo talagang nakatutok.

3579
05:30:38,080 --> 05:30:41,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But at the end of the day, we also need to stand up for –

3580
05:30:41,920 --> 05:30:49,360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: as best as we can for the territorial integrity and sovereignty of the country in the face

3581
05:30:49,360 --> 05:30:51,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: of overt attempts by China.

3582
05:30:51,920 --> 05:30:58,160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Even as the gentleman raised earlier, yung pagpapalit ng naratibo sa Batanes, by a

3583
05:30:58,160 --> 05:31:12,266
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: state university, part and parcel ng UFW ng China ito eh.

3584
05:31:12,266 --> 05:31:17,337
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ito'y realisasyon, hindi lang ng Pilipinas, pero maraming bansa.

3585
05:31:17,347 --> 05:31:25,379
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, sabi'ng pong palagay ay kesa sa wala tayong kapabilidad na to deter, no?

3586
05:31:25,784 --> 05:31:32,558
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the exercise is in deterrence, eh, rather than in reaction.

3587
05:31:32,558 --> 05:31:35,963
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's what we're trying to do as best as we can.

3588
05:31:35,963 --> 05:31:38,120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, salamat po sa katanungan.

3589
05:31:42,558 --> 05:31:43,120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Cong. Tinio.

3590
05:31:48,400 --> 05:31:51,350
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And finally, uh, the last person to interpolate.

3591
05:31:51,360 --> 05:31:52,878
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Madam?

3592
05:32:02,470 --> 05:32:02,790
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

3593
05:32:02,798 --> 05:32:05,520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes. Uh, Cong. Pleyto was registered for the first round.

3594
05:32:05,520 --> 05:32:08,000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: He would like to, um, ask his questions as well.

3595
05:32:08,000 --> 05:32:13,372
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But if it's okay, with the indulgence of Cong. Pleyto, may we recognize Cong. Sarah?

3596
05:32:13,709 --> 05:32:17,130
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po.

3597
05:32:17,130 --> 05:32:20,552
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maigli lang po dahil tayo rin po ay magsisponsor ng isang bill ngayon sa plenaryo.

3598
05:32:20,552 --> 05:32:23,974
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang question ko po ay saan po kumukuha ang AFP ng PONDO para sa kanyang mga learning tours?

3599
05:32:23,974 --> 05:32:27,395
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po bang learning tours?

3600
05:32:29,302 --> 05:32:30,162
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Learning tours?

3601
05:32:30,162 --> 05:32:31,023
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Educational trips?

3602
05:32:31,023 --> 05:32:34,150
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po education budget at meron naman po grants.

3603
05:32:34,170 --> 05:32:34,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: All right.

3604
05:32:35,039 --> 05:32:40,979
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: institutional arrangements with other countries like Australia, India, the United States, Japan, and Korea

3605
05:32:40,979 --> 05:32:48,781
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for professional military education like cadets.

3606
05:32:49,734 --> 05:32:56,871
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But we see the need to have to invest on a department level

3607
05:32:56,871 --> 05:33:03,963
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and on the military level for higher education on multidisciplinary aspects.

3608
05:33:04,081 --> 05:33:08,329
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay. Ang katanungan ko, Madam Chair, ay tungkol doon sa mga learning tours

3609
05:33:08,329 --> 05:33:14,653
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: involving educational institutions as well as other institutions for learning

3610
05:33:14,653 --> 05:33:19,167
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hino-host po natin dito sa bansa. May specific line item po ba para sa bansa?

3611
05:33:19,167 --> 05:33:24,328
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ito ay reserve force development po. Pero yung courses po sa education,

3612
05:33:24,850 --> 05:33:26,710
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eh, wala pong budget para doon.

3613
05:33:26,710 --> 05:33:31,030
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay. Sige. Hingin na lang po natin yung kopya ng report kung paano yan ginagastas.

3614
05:33:31,030 --> 05:33:33,359
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: These are the ROTC programs, actually.

3615
05:33:34,422 --> 05:33:40,550
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natanong natin ito, Madam Chair, kasi po, may concern din po na nilapit sa amin ng mga child rights advocates.

3616
05:33:40,941 --> 05:33:46,113
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Naghanda po kami ng ibang photos ng mga nakaabot sa atin na ulat

3617
05:33:46,113 --> 05:33:53,081
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na meron daw pong mga educational tours na hino-host ang ating military

3618
05:33:53,081 --> 05:33:58,448
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung saan dinaduluhan po ng mga bata na sila po ay pinapahawak ng mga baril.

3619
05:34:00,604 --> 05:34:03,747
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Opo. So, ito po ay tatlong instance.

3620
05:34:05,191 --> 05:34:12,998
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga detalye. Pero nandyan na po yan lahat. Pero ang katanungan ko po ay bakit po pinapahintulutan ito ng DND at AFP?

3621
05:34:13,032 --> 05:34:16,762
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Duly noted, Your Honor. Hindi dapat talaga umano yan.

3622
05:34:17,065 --> 05:34:17,930
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

3623
05:34:17,950 --> 05:34:18,550
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Duly noted.

3624
05:34:18,736 --> 05:34:28,456
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, nakapost pa po ito sa social media. At nakakabahala po kasi marami ng mga conventions.

3625
05:34:28,810 --> 05:34:34,025
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ako rin po nababahala dito. At hindi po po ito tolerate yung ganyang gawain. Whether posted or non-posted.

3626
05:34:34,193 --> 05:34:34,716
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

3627
05:34:35,240 --> 05:34:40,474
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, ang partner po dito sa Bukidnon, halimbawa Child Development Center,

3628
05:34:40,474 --> 05:34:46,755
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ibig sabihin po nasa six years old below yung mga participants niyan. So, ganun po ka-bata.

3629
05:34:46,755 --> 05:34:54,083
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya dapat may malinaw na palisiya na maipagbawal po yung ganitong paghahawak ng baril ng mga bata.

3630
05:34:54,083 --> 05:35:05,598
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalo na po sa mga incidents ngayon sa mga eskwelahan. Kung saan malaking issue ang gun access at ang safety po ng ating mga bata at kabataan sa ating mga bata.

3631
05:35:05,902 --> 05:35:16,128
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This is what I will do, Your Honor. I'll ask the DSWD to work with us to lecture to the units what are the proper engagement parameters for the youth under 18.

3632
05:35:18,575 --> 05:35:25,006
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pati po sa mga bata, dapat po matiyak natin na wala pong ganito.

3633
05:35:25,006 --> 05:35:27,502
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun nga po, yung minoritidad. As legally defined.

3634
05:35:27,502 --> 05:35:28,454
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes.

3635
05:35:28,454 --> 05:35:35,118
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I will ask the DSWD to, which we have close working relationships with.

3636
05:35:35,118 --> 05:35:38,926
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This is something that I cannot tolerate, Your Honor.

3637
05:35:39,668 --> 05:35:46,036
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po ba tayo sa inyong mga standards pagdating sa pag-uphold ng ating responsibility?

3638
05:35:46,036 --> 05:35:49,675
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po bang parusa yung ganitong tipo ng mga paglabag?

3639
05:35:50,013 --> 05:36:00,728
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ito po gawa ng palagay ko sa pagpapalit ng mission area ngayon ay lack of awareness ito.

3640
05:36:00,728 --> 05:36:03,650
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ngunit ako po ay personal kong...

3641
05:36:04,625 --> 05:36:17,288
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I papaloap ito at i-dedirect ko ang Undersecretary for Defense Administration to take charge of this.

3642
05:36:17,288 --> 05:36:18,262
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This should not happen.

3643
05:36:18,953 --> 05:36:21,902
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair. Dapat po mahigpit yan na maipagbawal.

3644
05:36:21,902 --> 05:36:29,766
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Chair, tungkol dun sa mga na-report po na ulat ng sexual assault within the military.

3645
05:36:29,766 --> 05:36:33,698
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napalakas na po ba natin halimbawa yung mga mechanisms for sexual assault prevention?

3646
05:36:33,698 --> 05:36:42,545
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para po matiyak na yung mga kaso, mga complaints na iimbestigahan at natitiyak natin na may pananagutan?

3647
05:36:43,726 --> 05:36:48,417
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That is one area po na nagtutulungan din po kami sa DSWD.

3648
05:36:48,417 --> 05:36:54,985
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi victim identification is also very important.

3649
05:36:54,985 --> 05:36:57,800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it's certainly something that we really cannot tolerate.

3650
05:36:57,800 --> 05:37:00,615
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Whether it is...

3651
05:37:00,615 --> 05:37:02,491
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ah...

3652
05:37:02,491 --> 05:37:06,929
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: heterosexual or otherwise.

3653
05:37:08,212 --> 05:37:15,978
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In this regard, Madam Chair, I'd like to put on record our request for the DND as well as all its attached agencies

3654
05:37:15,978 --> 05:37:20,832
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: to submit its compliance report on its gender and development mandate.

3655
05:37:20,832 --> 05:37:23,744
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga po yan dahil malaking bahagi din ang ating pondo.

3656
05:37:23,744 --> 05:37:28,598
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And lastly, Madam Chair, alam ko po patapos na rin po yung aking oras.

3657
05:37:28,598 --> 05:37:33,452
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At tungkol po sa deployment ng Civil-Military Operations Battalion

3658
05:37:33,452 --> 05:37:38,306
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa Metro Manila at sa ating mga siyudad.

3659
05:37:38,306 --> 05:37:43,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May guiding principles, may policies po ba ang DND tungkol dito?

3660
05:37:43,565 --> 05:37:44,565
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po.

3661
05:37:44,565 --> 05:37:52,561
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Lalo-lalo na ngayon ang major threat area po na pinagtututukan po nila ay ang United Front Works.

3662
05:37:52,561 --> 05:37:56,559
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's against foreign influence.

3663
05:37:56,559 --> 05:38:02,556
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We now have a consolidated CMO command.

3664
05:38:02,556 --> 05:38:17,548
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Which takes threats to national security on a more information-based basis.

3665
05:38:17,548 --> 05:38:22,546
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And now the major concentration is on foreign malign influence.

3666
05:38:23,255 --> 05:38:29,174
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Naintindihan po natin yung may kinalaman dun sa mga threats pagdating sa national security.

3667
05:38:29,174 --> 05:38:32,133
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero may mga nakaabot din po tayo na balita na...

3668
05:38:33,120 --> 05:38:37,066
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po, subject ng House Resolution No. 1203,

3669
05:38:37,066 --> 05:38:42,985
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung presence po ng 12 Civil-Military Operations Battalion sa Marikina, sa Caloocan.

3670
05:38:42,985 --> 05:38:50,877
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At may mga balita po, halimbawa, pinapapunta yung isang nanay na nagsasalita tungkol sa karapatan niya sa pabahay

3671
05:38:50,877 --> 05:38:52,850
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pinapatawag po at pinapasurrender.

3672
05:38:52,850 --> 05:39:01,728
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So yung ganitong tipo po ng mga kaso, dapat sa tingin po natin, dahil nagdadala ng tensyon, ng takot dun sa mga kababayan natin,

3673
05:39:01,728 --> 05:39:09,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na wala namang kinalaman sa external threats, wala namang kinalaman sa threats sa ating national security.

3674
05:39:09,620 --> 05:39:16,526
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In fact, ang hinaharap nila, threats sa kanilang housing, threats sa kanilang livelihood.

3675
05:39:16,526 --> 05:39:23,431
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sila po yung naapektuhan ng presence ng ganitong tipo ng batalyon sa kanilang mga lugar.

3676
05:39:23,617 --> 05:39:29,589
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Doon po sa usapin na yan, of course, internal security is also part and parcel nito.

3677
05:39:29,589 --> 05:39:35,561
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Part and parcel din ng CMO batalyon operations po ito.

3678
05:39:35,561 --> 05:39:51,486
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: What I can guarantee, Your Honor, is that we have to really also marshal our resources into something more tangible,

3679
05:39:51,486 --> 05:39:58,453
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: given the fact that the President himself has said that we need to pinch each and every peso right now.

3680
05:39:59,448 --> 05:40:09,402
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Given that, Your Honor, that's why we already created the CMO command on a national level,

3681
05:40:09,402 --> 05:40:20,350
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: so to have a more structured approach to information dissemination and to combat foreign malign information.

3682
05:40:21,262 --> 05:40:25,956
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair, kasi ang nangyayari dito, parang wala ho tayong tiwala dun sa civilian bureaucracy,

3683
05:40:25,956 --> 05:40:27,521
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tsaka sa local police natin para ma…

3684
05:40:28,303 --> 05:40:31,433
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ma-care of yung ganitong tipo ng mga usapin, kung meron man.

3685
05:40:31,433 --> 05:40:38,474
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At we'll take the word of the Secretary on this. At sana rin po, hindi lang po sa DND, dito rin po sa Kongreso,

3686
05:40:38,474 --> 05:40:42,386
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sana ho hindi natin mapalagpas na mapag-usapan ang mga mahalagang resolusyon na ito para matiyak ang…

3687
05:40:42,386 --> 05:40:47,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maliwanag po yung pinakita na may bata na may armas eh, yan di ko po…

3688
05:40:47,131 --> 05:40:53,290
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of course, yes. Opo.

3689
05:40:53,290 --> 05:40:57,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero pagdating po dito sa presence din ng CMO,

3690
05:40:57,500 --> 05:41:02,977
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa presence din po ng military sa ating mga communities, dapat may malinaw na pabantayan.

3691
05:41:02,977 --> 05:41:06,953
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Especially with the incidents of school shootings in Zamboanga, then you have this kind of things.

3692
05:41:06,953 --> 05:41:09,338
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I cannot allow that to happen.

3693
05:41:10,503 --> 05:41:18,263
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes. Maraming salamat, Madam Chair. At abangan po natin yung mga hiningi nating reports tungkol sa TICAS implementation,

3694
05:41:18,263 --> 05:41:26,993
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gayon din po sa lahat ng affected ng fishing ban na may kinalaman sa balikatan exercises, at iba pa nating mga hiningi.

3695
05:41:26,993 --> 05:41:33,783
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Manghingi na din po tayo ng status report tungkol po sa presence ng 12th CMO dito sa Metro Manila.

3696
05:41:33,783 --> 05:41:36,693
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair. Maraming salamat.

3697
05:41:37,368 --> 05:41:44,287
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Kong Sarah. Before we move to our last interpellator, we'd like to recognize Congressman Isidro Ungab.

3698
05:41:46,362 --> 05:41:53,360
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Thank you, Madam Chair. Actually, I have no question. I came here to support the budget of the DND and the AFP.

3699
05:41:53,760 --> 05:41:56,390
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Just to one matter, I would like to, uh—

3700
05:41:57,520 --> 05:41:59,440
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: After this, may I request for a

3701
05:41:59,440 --> 05:42:05,760
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: three minutes, uh, short meeting with the DND chief and Chief of Staff, sir.

3702
05:42:05,760 --> 05:42:13,360
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: This is a parochial concern about my district. Very, very short. Three minutes lang. I have prepared already the summary. Thank you, sir.

3703
05:42:14,189 --> 05:42:19,083
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, former chair of appropriations, Manong Sid.

3704
05:42:21,192 --> 05:42:27,335
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Kong Sid. So, for our last interpellator, I would like to recognize Kong Salvador Pleyto.

3705
05:42:28,634 --> 05:42:30,693
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming salamat.

3706
05:42:30,693 --> 05:42:40,615
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Madam Chair, gusto kong munang… wala na na… wala na na iwan. Ako na yata lahat sa ito.

3707
05:42:40,615 --> 05:42:52,000
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ating Secretary, ang idol ko, Secretary Gibo Teodoro. I've known him for… tagal pa.

3708
05:42:52,000 --> 05:43:00,080
