3769
05:50:14,400 --> 05:50:16,240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it is really a catch basin.

3770
05:50:16,240 --> 05:50:22,400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And unfortunately, Lahar had clogged our major thoroughfares.

3771
05:50:22,400 --> 05:50:25,920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And all I know, it needs a complex engineering solution.

3772
05:50:25,920 --> 05:50:31,840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Maybe requiring a new carriageway altogether.

3773
05:50:31,840 --> 05:50:34,000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And an elevated basis.

3774
05:50:34,000 --> 05:50:37,680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we saw that in Typhoon Ondoy.

